  "created": "2026-10-15T13:55:01.387Z",
  "description": "VDocs is a high-performance, standalone .NET document processing framework built for developers who need complete\ncontrol over Word (DOCX) and PDF documents — without using OpenXML SDK, Microsoft Word Interop, or any third-party\nPDF library.\n\nIt features a fully custom Document Object Model (DOM) capable of mapping bidirectionally to WordprocessingML, and\nnow includes three output engines driven by the same unified DOM:\n\n  • Word (DOCX) — full read/write support\n  • HTML — accurate, CSS-driven rendering of Word documents in modern browsers\n  • PDF — pure C# PDF 1.7 generation with no external dependencies\n\nThe PDF engine is built directly on the ISO 32000 specification and supports text with bold/italic/underline,\nautomatic word-wrap, paragraph alignment, tables with borders and shading, image embedding, headers/footers,\nhyperlinks, and document metadata — all without iTextSharp, PdfSharp, or any other library.\n\nThis package is distributed under a proprietary commercial license and requires a valid license key from VegaRise.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
